Every evidence-based-psychotherapy is a nonbenzodiazepine-anxiety-treatment.
Every specific-antidepressant is a nonbenzodiazepine-anxiety-treatment.
Every anxiety-approved-nonbenzodiazepine-medication is a nonbenzodiazepine-anxiety-treatment.
Every cognitive-behavioral-therapy is an evidence-based-psychotherapy.
If a patient has an anxiety and a clinician tapers a benzodiazepine for the patient then the clinician should offer a nonbenzodiazepine-anxiety-treatment to the patient.
If a patient has an anxiety and a clinician discontinues a benzodiazepine for the patient then the clinician should offer a nonbenzodiazepine-anxiety-treatment to the patient.
If a patient receives an opioid and requires an anxiety-treatment then every clinician should offer a nonbenzodiazepine-anxiety-treatment to the patient.
